%[text] %[text:anchor:T_157DFE85] # Reaction Analyzer
%[text] [⇦ Return to the main menu](file:../MainMenu.m)
%[text] In this script, you will design an experiment to measure the reaction time using several LEDs and push buttons. The data from those experiments will be post-processed using MATLAB. 
%[text]{"align":"center"} ![](text:image:886b)
%[text]{"align":"center"} This image was created using [fritzing-parts](https://github.com/fritzing/fritzing-parts/)
%%
%[text:tableOfContents]{"heading":"Table of Contents"}
%[text] %[text:anchor:H_7CAB0192] **Before you get started**
